              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uleelede kwaamba kuti, Amuswiilile ijwi lya-Jehova nubami ba-Juda anyoonse nomukede mu-Jerusalemu. Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli. Ncobeni njooleta mapenzi aayoosya kubusena obuno, elyo kufumbwa muntu uuteelela makani, matwi aakwe ayoopakamana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
