        {
          "text": "Nkaambo bantu banditakata, basofwaazya busena obuno kukutentela baleza bambi tununkilizyo, baleza mbebatakezi nibaba mbabo nibaba bamawisaabo nibaba bami ba-Juda, alimwi balizuzizye busena obuno bulowa bwabantu batakwe milandu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
