        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mumazuba aaboola, mbwaamba Jehova, busena obuno tabukooyooambwa limbi Tofeti nanka ikuti lyamwana wa-Hinomu, buyooambwa kuti ndikuti lyabujayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
