        {
          "text": "Nkabela mubusena obuno mbubonya njoolobya makanze ngebakanzide bantu ba-Juda aba-Jerusalemu, Njoobawisya kupanga kumaanza aabasinkondonyina babo akumaanza aabaabo bayanda kubajaya, amitunta yabo njooisanizya bayuni bakujulu abanyama baansi. ",
