          "text": "Nkabela njoobalisya nyama yabana babo balombe abana babo basimbi. Bayoolyana umwi aumwi mweenzinyina mukusinkinizigwa amumapenzi aabo, basinkondonyina babo aboonse bayandaula buumi bwabo nibayoobapenzya.",
