        {
          "text": "nkabela uleelede kubaambila kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Njoopwaya bantu aba amunzi uno mbubonya mbuli muntu mbwapwaya nongo yamubumbi iitakonzyi kuswanizigwa limbi. Lino banooyoozika bantu mu-Tofeti mane mukaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
